        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Shawl, fine blue woven silk, brocaded with flowers in silver-wrapped thread in the field and large buta in silver-wrapped and gold-wrapped thread in the corners, the borders consist of a band of fine red silk, with diagonal bands of flowers and gold-wrapped thread, and a second border of chevrons in gold-wrapped thread. The field has a circular design in the centre in red silk and silver-wrapped and gold-wrapped thread."@en ;
